      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING SILAS (1) flew the lids and led throughout to get off the mark with his maiden win, then finished a 5.5 lengths fourth last start at this track over 520m (30.46). Nicely drawn here. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. MAYFAIR SHINE (6) was quickly into stride and found the front last start to record an all-the-way win (25.26) at Maitland in a Grade 5 over 450m. Should be in this for a long way. ZIPPING FERLAZZO (7) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (30.06) at Richmond in a Grade 5. Has first look at box 7 this time. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Hard to beat again. FANTASY ETHICS (8) must be included in calculations.",
